       I have started to correspond with someone using nothing but
   lojban.  This situtation leads to mountains of questions .... I am
   left with very mixed emotions.  ... consumes a terribly large
   amount of bandwidth.  However, given that I did receive wrong
   answers, it is not clear that even questions as trivial as that are
