Not a waste.  I am interested in the questions and even more in the
answers.  Perhaps you can write in such a way as to reduce the number
of questions to a manageable flow ... :-)

One request: whenever you post Lojban, *please* include an English
word for word translation.  I often do not have the time to look up
words I don't know.  If you include the word-for-word, I will be much
more likely to read the message.

